tachyon-blueprint 1
# The RMS Carcosa, a liner on a black sea in a storm, for Grimoire's Lovecraftian games.
# Made by town/make-liner.mjs; edit that and run it again. `label x y Name` names a place.
name liner
size 120 60 2
key ~ floor water
key = floor teak
key S wall steel
key c floor carpet
key F wall funnel
key < stair-up wood
key > stair-down wood
key . floor water | sigil
key , floor hull | rail
key : floor teak | lamp
key ; floor carpet | door
key _ floor carpet | bed
key + floor carpet | chest
key # floor carpet | lamp
key % floor carpet | piano
key & floor teak | chair
key * floor teak | chest
key - floor carpet | chair
key ^ floor carpet | table
key " floor teak | barrel
key ' floor teak | bell
key ` floor teak | statue
key ! floor steel | rail
key ? floor teak | lifeboat
key $ floor teak | table
key @ floor teak | door
key A floor teak | wheel
level 0
